<p>Drossman DA, Hasker WL. Rome IV-functional GI disorders: disorders of gut-brain interaction. Gastroenterology 2016; 150:1257–1261.</p>

<p>Jamshed et al. Diagnostic approach to chronic constipation in adults. Am Fam Physician. 2011 Aug 1;84(3):299-306.</p>

<p>Longstreth et al. Functional Bowel Disorders. Gastroenterology. 2006;130 (5):1480</p>

<p>Mounsey et al. Management of constipation in older adults. Am Fam Physician. 2015 Sep 15;92(6):500-504.</p>

